The Issuing Entity
The issuing entity will file with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the “SEC”) all required annual reports on Form 10-K, distribution reports on Form 10-D, monthly asset level data files and related documents on Form ABS-EE, and current reports on Form 8-K. Those reports will be filed with the SEC under the name “Honda Auto Receivables 2024-4 Owner Trust” and file number 333-261436-10.", "score": 0.2559, "deals": [{"deal_name": "Honda Auto Receivables 2024-4 Owner Trust", "series": "", "accession": "0001104659-24-107060", "filing_date": "2024-10-08", "asset_class": "Auto loan", "page": "1", "doc_url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/890975/000110465924107060/tm2424075d3_424h.htm", "text_file": "data/text/AMERICAN_HONDA_RECEIVABLES_LLC_2024-10-08_424H.txt", "char_start": 11864, "char_end": 12330}], "supporting_quote_matched": false, "matched_expected_deal_ids": []}, {"rank": 2, "accessions": ["0001104659-24-058047"], "chunk_id": "", "text": "WHERE YOU CAN FIND MORE INFORMATION ABOUT YOUR NOTES
